"For this part, please refer to :ref:`toggling virtual environments and "
"customizing dependencies <model_launching_virtualenv>`."
msgstr "对于这部分，请参考 :ref:`开关虚拟空间和定制依赖 <model_launching_virtualenv>`。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:91
msgid "Batching / Continuous Batching"
msgstr "批处理 / 连续批处理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:93
msgid ""
"Xinference supports batching for higher throughput. For LLMs on the "
"``transformers`` engine, continuous batching is available and can be "
"enabled via environment variables at launch time."
msgstr ""
"Xinference支持批处理以提升吞吐量。对于基于 ``transformers`` "
"引擎的大型语言模型，可启用连续批处理功能，该功能可在启动时通过环境变量进行配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:96
msgid "Key settings:"
msgstr "关键设置："

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:98
msgid ""
"``XINFERENCE_BATCH_SIZE`` and ``XINFERENCE_BATCH_INTERVAL`` for general "
"batching behavior."
msgstr "``XINFERENCE_BATCH_SIZE`` 和 ``XINFERENCE_BATCH_INTERVAL`` 用于控制常规的批处理行为。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:101
msgid "Example (LLM, transformers):"
msgstr "示例（大型语言模型，Transformers）："

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:114
msgid ""
"For detailed behavior, supported models, and aborting requests, see "
":ref:`Continuous Batching <user_guide_continuous_batching>`."
msgstr ""
"有关详细行为、支持的模型以及中止请求的信息，请参阅"
" :ref:`连续批处理 <user_guide_continuous_batching>` 。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:118
msgid "Thinking Mode"
msgstr "思考模式"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:120
msgid ""
"Some hybrid reasoning models (for example, Qwen3) support an optional "
"*thinking mode*. You can enable this at launch time via ``--enable-"
"thinking``."
msgstr "某些混合推理模型（例如Qwen3）支持可选的 *思考模式* 。您可在启动时通过 ``--enable-thinking`` 参数启用该功能。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:171
msgid "Launch Configuration History"
msgstr "启动配置历史"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:173
msgid ""
"After a model is launched successfully from the Web UI, Xinference stores its "
"launch configuration in the Supervisor launch-history database and keeps a "
"user-scoped browser cache for fast access and temporary network failures. When "
"the deployment dialog is opened again, the newest server-backed configuration "
"is restored unless the user has already started editing the form."
msgstr "模型从 Web UI 成功启动后，Xinference 会将启动配置保存到 Supervisor 的启动历史数据库中，并按用户在浏览器中保留一份缓存，方便快速访问，也能应对短暂的网络故障。再次打开部署窗口时，会恢复服务端保存的最新配置；如果您已经开始编辑表单，则不会覆盖正在修改的内容。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:180
msgid ""
"The configuration history dialog can remove records owned by the current user. "
"Records used by automatic startup are protected from deletion. In authenticated "
"deployments, browser caches are separated by the username in the access token; "
"configuration data owned by another user is not placed in that cache."
msgstr "在配置历史窗口中，您可以删除自己的记录，但用于自动启动的记录不能删除。启用身份验证时，浏览器缓存会按访问令牌中的用户名隔离，不会混入其他用户的配置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/launch.rst:306
msgid ""
"The history dialog also lists configurations owned by the current user for "
"other model names. These records are never applied automatically. After the "
"user confirms **Use as Template**, Xinference keeps the current model name, "
"removes the previous model UID and history or automatic-startup metadata, and "
"copies the remaining launch options into the form without starting a model."
msgstr "历史窗口也会列出您在其他模型上保存的配置，但不会自动套用。确认 **用作模板** 后，Xinference 会保留当前模型名称，去掉原来的模型 UID、历史记录和自动启动相关信息，再将其余启动选项填入表单。这个操作只填写配置，不会启动模型。"

msgid "Download without launching"
msgstr "仅下载模型，不启动"

msgid "Open a model's deployment dialog and choose **Download only** beside the **Deploy** button. It downloads the same model artifacts used by deployment, but does not reserve GPUs, create model subprocesses, install a virtual environment, or load a model into memory."
msgstr "打开模型的部署窗口，点击 **部署** 旁边的 **仅下载**，就能提前下载部署所需的模型文件。这个操作不会占用 GPU、创建模型子进程、安装虚拟环境，也不会把模型加载到内存中。"

msgid "The REST endpoint is ``POST /v1/cache/models``. Supply ``cache_uid`` when the client needs to query progress or cancel the operation while the POST request is still running."
msgstr "对应的 REST 接口是 ``POST /v1/cache/models``。如果需要在请求尚未结束时查询进度或取消下载，请传入 ``cache_uid``，用它来标识这次下载任务。"

msgid "Progress and cancellation use the same ``cache_uid``:"
msgstr "查询进度和取消下载时，使用同一个 ``cache_uid``："

msgid "Cache-only downloads can also be paused and resumed:"
msgstr "仅下载任务也可以暂停和恢复："

msgid "Xinference persists unfinished cache-only download tasks. If the supervisor or worker stops unexpectedly, an active task is shown as ``interrupted`` after restart and can be resumed with the same endpoint. Resume reuses files already present in the model hub cache. Byte-range continuation of a partially written file depends on the selected hub client; otherwise that incomplete file is downloaded again."
msgstr "Xinference 会保存尚未完成的仅下载任务。如果 Supervisor 或工作节点意外停止，重启后，正在进行的任务会显示为 ``interrupted`` （已中断），可以通过上述恢复接口继续下载。恢复时会复用模型仓库缓存中已有的文件。下载了一部分的文件能否断点续传，取决于所选模型仓库的客户端；如果不支持，这个未完成的文件会重新下载。"

msgid "``GET /v1/downloads`` lists active, paused, interrupted, and failed downloads. Pause and resume apply to cache-only downloads. A model launch that happens to be downloading still uses the launch cancellation endpoint because pausing a launch would also need to preserve its runtime allocation state."
msgstr "``GET /v1/downloads`` 会列出正在下载、已暂停、已中断和失败的任务。暂停和恢复只适用于仅下载任务。如果是在启动模型的过程中下载文件，仍需使用启动取消接口，因为暂停整个启动过程还涉及保留已分配的运行资源。"

msgid "In a distributed deployment, ``worker_ip`` can select the worker whose local cache receives the files. If it is omitted, the supervisor selects one worker."
msgstr "在分布式部署中，可以通过 ``worker_ip`` 指定把文件下载到哪个工作节点的本地缓存。不指定时，Supervisor 会选择一个工作节点。"

msgid "Per-replica placement"
msgstr "为每个副本指定运行位置"

msgid "For distributed deployments, ``replica_config`` can pin every replica to a specific worker and optional GPU indexes. Worker addresses must use the full registered ``IP:port`` value. The number of entries must equal ``replica`` and each entry currently supports exactly one worker."
msgstr "在分布式部署中，可以用 ``replica_config`` 为每个副本指定工作节点，也可以进一步指定 GPU 编号。工作节点地址必须使用注册时的完整 ``IP:port``。配置条目数必须与 ``replica`` 一致，目前每个条目只能指定一个工作节点。"

msgid "The same placement can be supplied to ``xinference launch`` as a JSON array:"
msgstr "在命令行中，也可以将相同的位置配置作为 JSON 数组传给 ``xinference launch``："

msgid "``--replica_config`` remains available as a compatibility alias, but ``--replica-config`` is recommended. If ``--replica`` is omitted, the CLI derives it from the number of array entries. If it is supplied explicitly, it must equal that number."
msgstr "为兼容旧用法，``--replica_config`` 仍然可用，但建议使用 ``--replica-config``。如果省略 ``--replica``，命令行会按数组条目数确定副本数量；如果显式指定，则必须与条目数一致。"

msgid "``replica_config`` is mutually exclusive with the model-level ``worker_ip``, ``n_gpu``, and ``gpu_idx`` arguments, and with ``n_worker > 1``. The CLI therefore rejects ``--replica-config`` together with ``--worker-ip``, ``--gpu-idx``, a non-``auto`` ``--n-gpu``, or ``--n-worker`` greater than 1. Each replica currently targets exactly one worker. If ``replica_uid`` is omitted, Xinference assigns the stable default ``{model_uid}-{replica_index}`` (for example, ``my-model-0``). Omit ``gpu_idx`` and use ``n_gpu=\"auto\"`` to let the selected worker allocate GPUs automatically."
msgstr "``replica_config`` 不能与模型级的 ``worker_ip``、``n_gpu``、``gpu_idx`` 参数同时使用，也不支持 ``n_worker > 1``。因此，命令行不允许将 ``--replica-config`` 与 ``--worker-ip``、``--gpu-idx``、非 ``auto`` 的 ``--n-gpu`` 或大于 1 的 ``--n-worker`` 一起使用。目前，每个副本只能指定一个工作节点。如果省略 ``replica_uid``，Xinference 会使用稳定的默认名称 ``{model_uid}-{replica_index}``，例如 ``my-model-0``。省略 ``gpu_idx`` 并设置 ``n_gpu=\"auto\"``，则由选定的工作节点自动分配 GPU。"

msgid "Running models can be scaled by one or more replicas in a single operation. The new replicas reuse the existing launch configuration by default. You can override their model engine and device allocation without changing existing replicas. Placement is optional; if omitted, the supervisor selects a worker automatically."
msgstr "对于正在运行的模型，可以一次增加一个或多个副本。新副本默认复用已有的启动配置，您也可以单独调整新副本的引擎和设备分配，不影响已有副本。运行位置可以不指定，此时由 Supervisor 自动选择工作节点。"

msgid "For multiple replicas, ``replica_config`` may also be a list with one placement entry per new replica. If any replica in a multi-replica scale-up fails to launch, Xinference rolls back the replicas created by that operation."
msgstr "一次增加多个副本时，``replica_config`` 也可以是一个列表，为每个新副本提供一条位置配置。如果其中任何一个副本启动失败，Xinference 会回滚本次操作创建的副本。"

msgid "Scale-up is not supported for Xavier-distributed models or models launched with ``n_worker > 1``. Deleting the last replica terminates the running model."
msgstr "使用 Xavier 分布式运行的模型，以及通过 ``n_worker > 1`` 启动的模型，暂不支持增加副本。删除最后一个副本时，运行中的模型也会终止。"

msgid "During deployment, the progress endpoint ``GET /v1/models/{model_uid}/progress`` reports a stage for each replica. After model files finish downloading, a replica can report ``waiting_for_dependencies`` while another launch prepares its shared virtual environment, then ``installing_dependencies`` while packages are being installed, and ``loading`` after the environment is ready."
msgstr "部署期间，进度接口 ``GET /v1/models/{model_uid}/progress`` 会报告每个副本所处的阶段。模型文件下载完成后，如果另一个启动任务正在准备共享虚拟环境，副本会报告 ``waiting_for_dependencies``；安装依赖包时报告 ``installing_dependencies``；环境就绪后报告 ``loading``。"

msgid "The Web UI shows each replica's file download details inside its replica card."
msgstr "Web 界面会在各副本的卡片中显示该副本的文件下载详情。"

msgid "During dependency installation, each replica's progress includes the number of packages planned for the main install and the number already present in its virtual environment. A replica waiting for a shared environment has no install count of its own. If the installer cannot resolve a reliable plan, the count is omitted."
msgstr "安装依赖包期间，每个副本的进度会显示主安装任务计划安装的包数量，以及其虚拟环境中已有的包数量。等待共享环境的副本没有自己的安装计数。如果安装器无法解析出可靠的计划，则不显示计数。"

#: doc/source/user_guide/launch.rst
msgid ""
"For image and video models, batching depends on the selected native engine "
"and model. Diffusers does not use a Xinference step-level scheduler. See "
":ref:`image` and :ref:`video`."
msgstr ""
"图像和视频模型的批处理能力取决于所选原生引擎和模型。Diffusers 不使用 Xinference 自研的逐步调度器。请参阅 :ref:`image`"
" 和 :ref:`video`。"
